# Shared services excluded from the upstream Bitget ruleset only.
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX excludes the named domain and its descendants, on label boundaries.
# This does not block traffic or force DIRECT; other client routing rules still apply.
# Restore specific hosts in custom/bitget.list if required by your traffic logs.

# Shared certificate infrastructure
# https://www.amazontrust.com/ https://www.rapidssl.com/
# ss2.us is also required by unrelated software; see the linked review notes.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amazontrust.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,rapidssl.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ss2.us

# General messaging, verification and error monitoring services
# https://www.engagelab.com/ https://www.geetest.com/ https://www.airbrake.io/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,engagelab.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,engagelab.cc
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,geetest.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,airbrake.io

# General blockchain and wallet connection infrastructure
# https://www.alchemy.com/ https://arbitrum.io/ https://docs.reown.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,alchemy.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,arbitrum.io
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,web3modal.org

# Payment platforms used beyond Bitget
# https://fiat24.com/ https://www.marqeta.com/ https://www.paydify.com/
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fiat24.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,marqeta.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paydify.com
